    "answer": {
      "short": "$3.9\\text{ km/h}$",
      "worked": "The grid gives a drawing length of $8\\text{ cm}$ and width of $5\\text{ cm}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Drawing perimeter}&=2(8+5)\\\\\n&=26\\text{ cm}\\\\\n\\text{Actual perimeter}&=26\\times3000\\\\\n&=78\\,000\\text{ cm}\\\\\n&=0.78\\text{ km}\\\\\n\\text{Time}&=12\\div60=0.2\\text{ h}\\\\\n\\text{Average speed}&=\\frac{0.78}{0.2}\\\\\n&=3.9\\text{ km/h}\n\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
